// A540 C3 bring-up: GPU-visible memory, SMMUv2 mapping, CP ring/microcode and
// the GPMU firmware load. This is deliberately a single self-contained module:
// the display bring-up calls it only after C1/C2 has powered GX and started the
// 257 MHz gfx3d clock (sheng-gpu-power=7).
//
// The firmware blobs are generated by scripts/gen-a540-firmware.py from the
// local vendor cache; they are never committed.

